$cats['Personal Story']['Personal Story Where It Started'] = @('A childhood house sits at the bottom of an enormous ancient tree whose roots descend beneath it like an underground second world. Small fragments of childhood are almost hidden inside the root system rather than arranged around the house as symbols','A child runs through a field at night while hundreds of fireflies rise upward and gradually become stars. The landscape dissolves toward the top so the childhood memory seems to merge with imagination','A battered bicycle races downhill through an exaggerated childhood neighborhood where houses stretch backward in dramatic perspective. The rider is tiny compared with the enormous world ahead','An old bedroom is shown with one wall completely missing opening directly onto an impossible night sky. Toys and furniture remain grounded and realistic while the universe begins inches beyond the bed','Two dirty childhood hands grip the edge of a wooden fence while enormous summer weeds and wildflowers tower beyond like a jungle. The ordinary backyard becomes the gigantic world it felt like as a child','A child dives from an old dock into black water but beneath the surface is an enormous luminous underwater universe instead of an ordinary lake. The tiny human figure creates scale','A weathered pickup truck sits beneath a huge thunderstorm while a child watches from the open passenger door. Lightning illuminates the vehicle and landscape with the drama of an epic painting','A small figure lies in tall grass looking upward while clouds form enormous dreamlike creatures overhead. The composition is about the feeling of having an entire afternoon with nowhere to be','An old staircase rises through darkness toward a brilliantly illuminated doorway with a child halfway up. Architectural realism gradually becomes impossible geometry toward the top','A child swings impossibly high from an enormous tree branch with the arc of the swing carrying through clouds and into open sky. The entire composition exaggerates how enormous childhood freedom felt')
$cats['Personal Story']['Personal Story The Good Times'] = @('Four friends leap from a rocky cliff into brilliantly colored water at the exact instant before impact. Their bodies form a sweeping diagonal while sunlight fractures across the water beneath them','A crowded nighttime diner is viewed through rain-covered glass from outside. Warm interior light silhouettes friends laughing in a booth while neon reflections stretch across the wet street','An old convertible drives toward an enormous sunset while the road bends impossibly upward into the sky. Tiny figures inside the car keep the story human while the landscape becomes surreal','Two people dance barefoot in a kitchen while the room gradually dissolves into sweeping painterly movement around them. Plates windows and cabinets remain realistic near the figures before disappearing into abstraction','A nighttime swimming pool glows electric blue while several friends are frozen midair above the water. Ripples below become concentric abstract rings extending through the composition','A tiny beach bonfire burns beneath a massive star-filled sky with a loose circle of friends barely visible around it. Smoke rises and merges with the Milky Way','A musician stands on a tiny club stage viewed from inside the crowd with hands and silhouettes framing the performer. Stage light explodes outward into expressive color and ink','Two friends ride motorcycles down an empty desert road toward an approaching storm. The road and cloud system dominate the artwork making the riders feel like part of something enormous','A group of friends cram into an old photo booth but the strips of photographs unravel downward and transform into flowing illustrated memories','A rooftop party above a glowing city is captured from behind one person sitting on the ledge. Fireworks and distant windows create an enormous field of light without turning into celebratory clip art')
$cats['Personal Story']['Personal Story The Bad Ideas'] = @('A motel room door hangs open at night while red neon spills across the floor. Beyond the doorway is not another hallway but an enormous desert under moonlight','A beautifully rendered vintage car sits half submerged in a swimming pool after an obviously terrible night. Palm trees and distant city lights remain strangely peaceful around the absurd scene','A figure climbs through a second-story window while shoes dangle from one hand and moonlight cuts across the building. Dramatic perspective makes the architecture feel like a film still','A shattered champagne glass floats in slow motion while the liquid inside becomes an entire nighttime cityscape. The accident itself becomes elegant rather than comedic','A figure runs barefoot down an empty city street at 3 AM carrying their shoes while headlights glow far behind. Wet pavement turns the entire scene into reflections','A poker table viewed from directly above becomes increasingly surreal toward its edges with cards hands chips and smoke spiraling outward into darkness','An old neon motel sign bends in a desert wind while its glowing letters break loose and drift upward like sparks. The image feels like a memory whose details are disappearing','A man in a suit walks calmly away from an enormous burning pile of his former possessions. The scene is elegant and cinematic rather than cartoon destruction','A high heel hangs from a telephone wire above an empty street at sunrise. Long shadows and subtle remnants of nightlife suggest an entire night without illustrating it','A figure falls backward from a rooftop into a vast field of flowers rather than toward the street below. Urban architecture above transforms into impossible nature beneath')
$cats['Personal Story']['Personal Story Love Sex and Heartbreak'] = @('Two lovers lie facing each other while the negative space between their profiles becomes a third abstract form resembling flame. The bodies remain elegant and anatomical','Two figures kiss inside a rain-soaked car at night while streetlights smear across the windows. The composition feels stolen from a film rather than posed romance','A woman steps through the silhouette of a man as though leaving his shadow behind. Her figure becomes increasingly colorful while the abandoned shadow remains monochrome','Two hands almost touch across a narrow gap but their shadows beneath are still holding each other. The visual contradiction carries the relationship without hearts or broken rings','A luxurious unmade bed floats alone in a black ocean beneath moonlight. Rumpled sheets and two depressions in the pillows suggest the people without showing them','A womans portrait appears through fractured mirror pieces but each reflection shows a subtly different emotional expression. One shard contains the silhouette of someone walking away','Two bodies dancing closely gradually dissolve into one sweeping piece of fabric making it difficult to see where one person ends and the other begins','A burning love letter is shown only as folded paper and flame with the smoke above becoming two faces that almost touch before disappearing','A solitary figure sits at the edge of a huge bed while morning light cuts sharply across the room. The empty half of the bed dominates the composition','Two lovers underwater reach for one another through turbulent blue and black currents their bodies nearly touching while water pulls them in opposite directions')
